บ                           1.4     Hardware                                 บ
บ                                                                            บ
บ    What intrim and long term policies should be adopted for phase out      บ
บ    and migration of existing NCR tower based UNIX application ?            บ
ศออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออผ

        The current application running on the NCR tower platform could 
        be used with the proposed hardware solution in one of three ways.

        i)      The current application could stay as it is and run
                in a standalone manner.

                This would have the effect of stagnating the growth of the 
                current application and limiting the information available
                in that application to the NCR tower system.

        ii)     The current NCR towers could be networked with the proposed
                hardware solution so that both systems could share the same 
                information.

                This would impose a limit to the number of concurrent 
                accesses to the application but the data available from 
                that system would be made available for other applications.

        iii)    The application could be ported, along with the data onto
                the proposed hardware platform.  

                This would take longer, and require more investment but 
                would open the application to more expansion and integration 
                with the new applications.
        
