    Mainframes

        Unisys Open/OLTP addresses the requirement to access mainframe 
        databases based on proprietary OLTP architechtures.  With 
        Open/CONNECT, data can be accessed from mainframe databases and 
        automatically loaded into Informix or Oracle relational database 
        management systems.  This provides applications and users access to 
        mainframe data. Similarly data can be sent to the mainframe for
        processing and loading into the host applications.

